---
const {tool}=Astro.props;
const mode=tool.mode;
---
<section class={"workspace-panel workspace-"+mode} data-tool-root data-tool-id={tool.id} data-mode={mode} aria-labelledby="workspace-title">
<div class="workspace-top"><div><span class="eyebrow">{tool.category.toUpperCase()} WORKSPACE</span><h2 id="workspace-title">{tool.name}</h2><p>{mode==="word-counter"?"Live statistics as you type.":mode==="text-diff"?"Two versions in, differences out.":"Make the changes you need, then review the result."}</p></div><span class="privacy-chip"><i></i> Browser-side processing</span></div>
{mode==="image-resizer"&&<div class="tool-controls image-size-workbench">
<label class="upload-tile upload-tile-red"><span class="upload-glyph">↥</span><strong>Choose an image</strong><small>JPG, PNG, WebP and browser-supported formats</small><input data-files type="file" accept="image/*" class="file-input"/></label>
<div class="dimension-presets"><span class="control-kicker">START WITH A SIZE</span><div class="preset-buttons"><button type="button" data-preset="640x640">Square</button><button type="button" data-preset="1280x720">Video 16:9</button><button type="button" data-preset="1200x630">Social</button><button type="button" data-preset="1920x1080">Full HD</button></div></div>
<div class="field-grid"><label class="field-label">Width <span class="unit-label">PX</span><input data-width type="number" min="1" max="12000" value="1200"/></label><label class="field-label">Height <span class="unit-label">PX</span><input data-height type="number" min="1" max="12000" value="800"/></label></div>
<label class="check-row ratio-lock"><input data-lock type="checkbox" checked/> Lock aspect ratio</label>
<label class="field-label">Export as<select data-format><option value="image/webp">WebP — smaller files</option><option value="image/jpeg">JPEG — photos</option><option value="image/png">PNG — transparency</option></select></label>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Resize image <span>→</span></button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">↔</span><p>Your resized image will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="image-compressor"&&<div class="tool-controls compression-workbench">
<div class="compress-drop"><div class="compress-big-icon">⇣</div><div><strong>Drop the weight, keep the detail.</strong><p>Select a photo and tune its output quality.</p></div><label class="button button-secondary">Choose image<input data-files type="file" accept="image/*" class="visually-hidden-file"/></label></div>
<div class="compression-settings"><div class="quality-heading"><div><span class="control-kicker">COMPRESSION QUALITY</span><strong data-quality-value>82%</strong></div><span class="quality-pill">Balanced</span></div><input data-quality type="range" min="15" max="100" value="82"/><div class="range-scale"><span>Smaller file</span><span>Sharper image</span></div><label class="field-label">Output format<select data-format><option value="image/webp">WebP</option><option value="image/jpeg">JPEG</option><option value="image/png">PNG (lossless)</option></select></label></div>
<div class="compression-note"><span>✦</span><div><strong>See the numbers before you decide</strong><p>The result will show original size, output size and the difference. Lower lossy quality usually means a smaller file.</p></div></div>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Compress image →</button><div class="result-box compression-result" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">◉</span><p>Compression details and download will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="image-converter"&&<div class="tool-controls format-converter-workbench">
<div class="convert-source"><span class="control-kicker">SOURCE IMAGE</span><label class="file-picker-row"><span class="picker-icon">▧</span><span><strong>Select an image</strong><small>Choose the original format from your device.</small></span><input data-files type="file" accept="image/*" class="file-input"/></label></div>
<div class="format-direction"><span class="format-source-pill">YOUR IMAGE</span><span class="format-arrow">↓</span><span class="format-destination-label">CONVERT TO</span></div>
<div class="format-choice-grid"><label class="format-choice"><input type="radio" name="target-format" value="image/webp" checked data-format-option/><span class="format-choice-ext">WEBP</span><strong>WebP</strong><small>Web-ready size</small></label><label class="format-choice"><input type="radio" name="target-format" value="image/jpeg" data-format-option/><span class="format-choice-ext">JPG</span><strong>JPEG</strong><small>Photo sharing</small></label><label class="format-choice"><input type="radio" name="target-format" value="image/png" data-format-option/><span class="format-choice-ext">PNG</span><strong>PNG</strong><small>Sharp graphics</small></label><select data-format class="visually-hidden-select"><option value="image/webp">WebP</option><option value="image/jpeg">JPEG</option><option value="image/png">PNG</option></select></div>
<label class="field-label quality-optional">Quality for WebP/JPEG <input data-quality type="range" min="20" max="100" value="90"/><span class="field-hint">PNG export is lossless; quality does not affect it.</span></label>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Convert format →</button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">⇄</span><p>The converted image will be ready here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="image-cropper"&&<div class="tool-controls crop-workbench">
<div class="crop-upload-bar"><label class="button button-secondary">Open image<input data-files type="file" accept="image/*" class="visually-hidden-file"/></label><span class="crop-status" data-crop-source>Nothing selected</span></div>
<div class="crop-preview-stage"><img data-image-preview alt="Source image preview" hidden/><div class="crop-empty"><span>▣</span><strong>Your crop starts here</strong><small>Choose a source image to view its size.</small></div></div>
<div class="crop-coordinates"><div class="crop-coordinate-title"><span class="control-kicker">CROP AREA · PIXELS</span><span>Top-left origin</span></div><div class="crop-ratio-presets" aria-label="Crop aspect ratio"><button type="button" data-crop-ratio="free" class="is-selected">Free</button><button type="button" data-crop-ratio="1:1">1:1 Square</button><button type="button" data-crop-ratio="4:3">4:3</button><button type="button" data-crop-ratio="3:2">3:2 Photo</button><button type="button" data-crop-ratio="16:9">16:9 Video</button></div><div class="field-grid"><label class="field-label">Left (X)<input data-crop-x type="number" min="0" value="0"/></label><label class="field-label">Top (Y)<input data-crop-y type="number" min="0" value="0"/></label><label class="field-label">Crop width<input data-crop-width type="number" min="1" value="800"/></label><label class="field-label">Crop height<input data-crop-height type="number" min="1" value="600"/></label></div><p class="field-hint">Choose a ratio preset or enter a custom crop. The area must fit inside the source image.</p></div>
<div class="field-grid"><label class="field-label">Output format<select data-format><option value="image/webp">WebP</option><option value="image/jpeg">JPEG</option><option value="image/png">PNG</option></select></label><label class="field-label">Quality <input data-quality type="range" min="20" max="100" value="90"/></label></div>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Crop selection →</button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">▣</span><p>Your cropped image will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="image-rotator"&&<div class="tool-controls rotation-workbench">
<div class="rotation-preview"><img data-image-preview alt="Rotated image preview" hidden/><div class="rotation-empty"><span>⟳</span><strong>Turn your image</strong><small>Pick a photo to begin</small></div><span class="rotation-degree-tag" data-angle-label>90° clockwise</span></div>
<label class="file-picker-row"><span class="picker-icon">＋</span><span><strong>Choose source image</strong><small>Your original file will not be changed.</small></span><input data-files type="file" accept="image/*" class="file-input"/></label>
<div class="rotation-controls"><span class="control-kicker">ROTATION</span><div class="rotation-angle-options"><button type="button" data-angle="90" class="is-selected"><span>↻</span>90°</button><button type="button" data-angle="180"><span>⟳</span>180°</button><button type="button" data-angle="270"><span>↺</span>270°</button></div></div>
<label class="field-label">Export format<select data-format><option value="image/jpeg">JPEG</option><option value="image/png">PNG</option><option value="image/webp">WebP</option></select></label>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Rotate and export →</button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">⟳</span><p>The rotated file will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="merge-pdf"&&<div class="tool-controls pdf-merge-workbench">
<div class="merge-drop-panel"><span class="pdf-stack-icon">▤</span><strong>Bring documents together</strong><p>Add at least two PDFs. The chosen file order determines the page order in the result.</p><label class="button button-secondary">Add PDF files<input data-files type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf" multiple class="visually-hidden-file"/></label></div>
<div class="merge-queue"><div class="queue-heading"><span>MERGE QUEUE</span><span data-list-count>0 documents</span></div><div data-selected-list class="selected-files-list"><div class="queue-empty">Your selected PDFs will be listed here.</div></div></div>
<div class="merge-tip"><strong>Order matters</strong><span>Choose files in the intended sequence in your file picker. The source documents remain unchanged.</span></div>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Merge PDF files →</button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">＋</span><p>Your combined PDF will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="extract-pdf-pages"&&<div class="tool-controls pdf-extract-workbench">
<div class="extract-hero"><span class="extract-hero-icon">↗</span><div><strong>Keep the pages you need.</strong><p>Save selected pages into a smaller, separate PDF.</p></div></div>
<label class="field-label">Source PDF<input data-files type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf" class="file-input"/></label>
<div class="range-example"><span class="control-kicker">PAGE SELECTION</span><div class="range-example-visual"><span>1</span><b>2</b><span>3–5</span><span>6</span><b>7</b></div><small>Enter single pages and ranges separated by commas.</small></div>
<div class="pdf-page-operation" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Choose what to do with selected pages"><label class="pdf-operation-choice"><input type="radio" name="pdf-page-action" value="extract" data-page-action checked/><span><strong>Extract pages</strong><small>Create a new PDF containing only these pages.</small></span></label><label class="pdf-operation-choice"><input type="radio" name="pdf-page-action" value="remove" data-page-action/><span><strong>Remove pages</strong><small>Create a new PDF without these pages.</small></span></label></div>
<label class="field-label">Pages to process<input data-pages type="text" placeholder="Example: 1, 3-5, 8" autocomplete="off"/><span class="field-hint">Page numbers start at 1. The page count is checked when you export.</span></label>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Extract selected pages →</button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">↗</span><p>Your new PDF will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="rotate-pdf-pages"&&<div class="tool-controls pdf-rotate-workbench">
<div class="pdf-rotate-illustration"><div class="paper-sheet"><span>PDF</span><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>⟳</b></div><div><strong>Fix sideways pages</strong><p>Rotate every page or just the pages you specify.</p></div></div>
<label class="field-label">PDF document<input data-files type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf" class="file-input"/></label>
<div class="rotation-controls"><span class="control-kicker">ROTATE BY</span><div class="rotation-angle-options"><button type="button" data-pdf-angle="90" class="is-selected">90° clockwise</button><button type="button" data-pdf-angle="180">180°</button><button type="button" data-pdf-angle="270">270°</button></div></div>
<label class="field-label">Pages <span class="optional-label">OPTIONAL</span><input data-pages type="text" placeholder="Leave blank to rotate all pages"/><span class="field-hint">Examples: 1, 3-5, 8. Existing page rotation is taken into account.</span></label>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Rotate PDF pages →</button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">⟳</span><p>Your adjusted PDF will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="images-to-pdf"&&<div class="tool-controls images-pdf-workbench">
<div class="images-pdf-drop"><span class="images-pdf-glyph">▧<b>＋</b></span><h3>Photos in. Document out.</h3><p>Each chosen image becomes a page. The picture is scaled to fit without stretching.</p><label class="button button-secondary">Select images<input data-files type="file" accept="image/*" multiple class="visually-hidden-file"/></label></div>
<div class="images-pdf-count" data-list-count>0 pictures selected</div>
<div class="page-size-options"><span class="control-kicker">PAGE SIZE</span><label><input type="radio" name="pdf-page-size" value="a4" checked data-page-size/><span class="page-mini">A4</span><strong>A4</strong><small>210 × 297 mm</small></label><label><input type="radio" name="pdf-page-size" value="letter" data-page-size/><span class="page-mini page-letter">US</span><strong>Letter</strong><small>8.5 × 11 in</small></label></div>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Create PDF from images →</button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">▤</span><p>Your photo document will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="inspect-pdf"&&<div class="tool-controls pdf-inspector-workbench">
<div class="inspector-file"><span class="inspector-document-icon">PDF</span><div><strong>Document details</strong><p>Inspect basic properties embedded in a PDF.</p></div></div>
<label class="file-picker-row"><span class="picker-icon">↥</span><span><strong>Choose a PDF</strong><small>Maximum 100 MB for this inspector.</small></span><input data-files type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf" class="file-input"/></label>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Inspect document →</button><div class="result-box inspector-results" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">⌕</span><p>Page count and available metadata will appear here.</p></div>
<div class="inspection-caveat"><b>ⓘ</b><span>Metadata can be missing or incorrect. This is not a malware scanner or a digital-signature validator.</span></div></div>}
{mode==="word-counter"&&<div class="tool-controls word-count-workbench">
<div class="word-metrics"><div class="word-primary-metric"><strong data-words>0</strong><span>WORDS</span></div><div><strong data-characters>0</strong><span>Characters</span></div><div><strong data-no-spaces>0</strong><span>No spaces</span></div><div><strong data-sentences>0</strong><span>Sentences</span></div><div><strong data-paragraphs>0</strong><span>Paragraphs</span></div><div class="time-metric"><strong data-reading-time>0 min</strong><span>Reading time</span></div><div class="time-metric"><strong data-speaking-time>0 min</strong><span>Speaking time</span></div></div>
<label class="field-label writing-label">YOUR TEXT<textarea data-input-text rows="10" placeholder="Start typing or paste your writing here…"></textarea></label>
<div class="writing-footer"><span>Live count · Nothing is submitted</span><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-clear>Clear text</button><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-copy-input>Copy text</button></div></div>}
{mode==="case-converter"&&<div class="tool-controls case-workbench">
<label class="field-label">Original text<textarea data-input-text rows="6" placeholder="Paste text to transform…"></textarea></label>
<div class="case-action-deck"><span class="control-kicker">CHOOSE A STYLE</span><div class="case-action-grid"><button type="button" data-case="upper"><b>AA</b><span>UPPERCASE</span></button><button type="button" data-case="lower"><b>aa</b><span>lowercase</span></button><button type="button" data-case="title"><b>Aa</b><span>Title Case</span></button><button type="button" data-case="sentence"><b>Ab</b><span>Sentence case</span></button><button type="button" data-case="camel"><b>aB</b><span>camelCase</span></button><button type="button" data-case="snake"><b>a_b</b><span>snake_case</span></button><button type="button" data-case="kebab"><b>a-b</b><span>kebab-case</span></button><button type="button" data-case="alternating"><b>aA</b><span>Alternating</span></button></div></div>
<div class="case-output-header"><label class="field-label" for="case-output">Converted text</label><button class="text-button" type="button" data-copy>Copy result</button></div><textarea id="case-output" data-result-text rows="6" placeholder="Your converted text will appear here…" readonly></textarea><div data-message role="status" aria-live="polite" class="result-message"></div></div>}
{mode==="remove-duplicate-lines"&&<div class="tool-controls dedupe-workbench">
<label class="field-label">PASTE YOUR LIST<textarea data-input-text rows="8" placeholder={"apples\nbananas\napples\noranges\nbananas"}></textarea></label>
<div class="dedupe-options"><label class="check-row"><input data-case-sensitive type="checkbox"/> Match case exactly</label><label class="check-row"><input data-trim-lines type="checkbox" checked/> Ignore spaces around lines</label></div>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Clean duplicate lines <span>✦</span></button>
<div class="dedupe-summary" data-message role="status" aria-live="polite">Your cleaned list will appear in the result panel.</div>
<label class="field-label">CLEANED LIST<textarea data-result-text rows="8" placeholder="Unique lines will appear here…" readonly></textarea></label><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-copy>Copy cleaned list</button></div>}
{mode==="json-formatter"&&<div class="tool-controls json-workbench">
<div class="json-editor-head"><span class="json-lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>JSON / EDITOR</strong><span class="json-lang-badge">JSON</span></div>
<label class="field-label"><span class="editor-label-row">Input <small>Paste or type JSON</small></span><textarea data-input-text rows="9" spellcheck="false" class="code-textarea" placeholder={'{"name":"Nexauren","tools":["image","pdf"]}'}></textarea></label>
<div class="json-actions"><button type="button" data-json-action="format" class="button button-primary">Beautify JSON ↴</button><button type="button" data-json-action="minify" class="button button-secondary">Minify</button><button type="button" data-json-action="sort" class="button button-secondary">Sort keys A–Z</button><button type="button" data-copy class="button button-secondary">Copy output</button></div>
<div class="json-status" data-message role="status" aria-live="polite">Ready to validate JSON syntax.</div>
<label class="field-label"><span class="editor-label-row">Output <small>Validated result</small></span><textarea data-result-text rows="9" spellcheck="false" class="code-textarea" placeholder="Formatted JSON will appear here…" readonly></textarea></label></div>}
{mode==="text-diff"&&<div class="tool-controls diff-workbench">
<div class="diff-editor-grid"><label class="field-label"><span class="diff-pane-title"><i class="diff-original-dot"></i> Original version</span><textarea data-diff-a rows="10" placeholder="Paste the original text…"></textarea></label><label class="field-label"><span class="diff-pane-title"><i class="diff-revised-dot"></i> Revised version</span><textarea data-diff-b rows="10" placeholder="Paste the revised text…"></textarea></label></div>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Compare versions <span>⇄</span></button>
<div class="diff-stats" data-diff-stats><span>Added <b data-diff-added>—</b></span><span>Removed <b data-diff-removed>—</b></span><span>Unchanged <b data-diff-unchanged>—</b></span></div>
<div data-diff-output class="diff-output" aria-live="polite"><p>Difference report will appear here. Green lines are added; red lines are removed.</p></div><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-copy-diff>Copy difference report</button></div>}
{mode==="audio-trimmer"&&<div class="tool-controls audio-trim-workbench">
<div class="audio-load-card"><span class="audio-icon-round">✂</span><div><strong>Load an audio clip</strong><p>Choose a source file your browser can decode.</p></div><label class="button button-secondary">Choose audio<input data-files type="file" accept="audio/*,.mp3,.wav,.m4a,.ogg,.aac,.flac" class="visually-hidden-file"/></label></div>
<audio data-preview controls hidden></audio><div class="audio-source-info" data-audio-info hidden></div>
<div class="trim-time-grid"><label class="field-label">START AT (SECONDS)<input data-start type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="0"/></label><label class="field-label">END AT (SECONDS)<input data-end type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="0"/></label></div>
<div class="trim-timeline"><span>IN</span><div class="timeline-track"><i></i><b></b></div><span>OUT</span></div><p class="field-hint">The result exports as 16-bit PCM WAV, which may be larger than the source.</p>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Cut selected segment →</button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">✂</span><p>Your trimmed audio clip will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="audio-to-wav"&&<div class="tool-controls audio-convert-workbench">
<div class="audio-convert-heading"><span class="audio-wave-badge">♫</span><div><strong>Convert to uncompressed WAV</strong><p>Make a standard PCM audio file for editing or sharing.</p></div></div>
<label class="audio-file-target"><span>Choose source audio</span><small>MP3, M4A, OGG, FLAC and other browser-decodable files</small><input data-files type="file" accept="audio/*,.mp3,.wav,.m4a,.ogg,.aac,.flac" class="file-input"/></label>
<audio data-preview controls hidden></audio><div data-audio-info class="audio-source-info" hidden></div>
<div class="wav-spec-list"><div><span>Codec</span><strong>PCM uncompressed</strong></div><div><span>Sample rate</span><strong>Source sample rate</strong></div><div><span>Bit depth</span><strong>16-bit</strong></div></div>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Convert audio → WAV</button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">♫</span><p>Your WAV export will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="audio-joiner"&&<div class="tool-controls audio-join-workbench">
<div class="join-intro"><span class="join-icon">⋈</span><div><strong>Build one continuous track</strong><p>Selected clips will play in the order shown by the file picker.</p></div></div>
<label class="join-upload"><span>＋</span><strong>Add audio clips</strong><small>Select at least two files</small><input data-files type="file" accept="audio/*,.mp3,.wav,.m4a,.ogg,.aac,.flac" multiple class="visually-hidden-file"/></label>
<div class="join-track-header"><span>YOUR PLAYLIST</span><span data-list-count>0 clips</span></div><div data-selected-list class="join-track-list"><div class="queue-empty">Your selected clips will appear here.</div></div>
<div class="join-format-note"><span>WAV</span><p>Clips are resampled to a common rate. The resulting file can be large, so keep the combined duration reasonable.</p></div>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Join audio clips →</button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">⋈</span><p>Your joined track will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="audio-speed-changer"&&<div class="tool-controls speed-workbench">
<div class="speed-dial"><div class="speed-dial-face"><span>PLAYBACK SPEED</span><strong data-speed-value>1.0×</strong><small data-speed-label>Normal speed</small></div></div>
<label class="speed-file-input field-label">Source audio<input data-files type="file" accept="audio/*,.mp3,.wav,.m4a,.ogg,.aac,.flac" class="file-input"/></label><audio data-preview controls hidden></audio><div data-audio-info class="audio-source-info" hidden></div>
<div class="speed-control"><div class="speed-range-head"><span>Slower</span><span>Faster</span></div><input data-speed type="range" min="0.5" max="2" step="0.1" value="1"/><div class="speed-ticks"><span>0.5×</span><span>1×</span><span>1.5×</span><span>2×</span></div></div>
<div class="speed-duration-card"><span>Estimated output duration</span><strong data-speed-duration>Load audio first</strong></div><p class="field-hint">This is resampling, so changing speed also changes pitch.</p>
<button class="button button-primary tool-submit" data-run type="button">Export at this speed →</button><div class="result-box" data-output aria-live="polite"><span class="result-placeholder-icon">⏩</span><p>Your speed-adjusted WAV will appear here.</p></div></div>}
{mode==="audio-inspector"&&<div class="tool-controls audio-inspector-workbench">
<label class="audio-inspector-upload"><span class="audio-inspector-glyph">∿</span><span><strong>Choose audio to inspect</strong><small>Audio remains in this browser tab.</small></span><input data-files type="file" accept="audio/*,.mp3,.wav,.m4a,.ogg,.aac,.flac" class="file-input"/></label>
<audio data-preview controls hidden></audio><canvas data-waveform width="640" height="120" aria-label="Audio waveform preview"></canvas>
